      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Atenolol was tested for its effect on the fatty acid spectrum of serum low-density lipoproteins in patients with coronary heart disease in winter and summer. There was a significant increase in saturated fatty acids and a reduction in unsaturated fatty acids during treatment."},
